<cem:title lang="" subtitle="">Lesson Test</cem:title>
<cem:description lang="">This virtual learning object "Lesson Test" that makes part of the lesson No: 6, First Day of Work which belongs to English teaching Upper-intermediate (B2.2), is intended to work on: analyze issues relating to different topics and their solution in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts; describe necessity, duty, advice, or strong dissaproval in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts; identify ways of improving aspects of communication in english based on the learning outcomes for level upper intermediate. The purpose of this object is to: express necessity, duty, and advice; express true, untrue, and possible events in present and past; exchange opinions; request or report facts about events or actions; deal with communication breakdowns; explain how to do things; discuss hopes and expectations for the future; write about facts about events or actions; write about hopes and expectations for the future. It evaluates grammar, vocabulary, and pronunciation.</cem:description>
